Seika_Lanternport_House2_Text_Npc0::
	.string "Last week a big ship came by\n"
	.string "from KANTO with strange people.\p"
	.string "A man with dirt on his gloves.\n"
	.string "A woman in a fine coat.\p"
	.string "They asked the way to INKBRUSH,\n"
	.string "not to the festival. Odd folk.$"
	.string "{JPN}{JPN}せんしゅう　カントーから　おおきな　ふねが\n"
	.string "きてね。　へんな　ひとたちが　のって　おったよ。\p"
	.string "てぶくろが　どろだらけの　おとこと　りっぱな\n"
	.string "コートの　おんな。\p"
	.string "まつりじゃ　なくて　スミフデへの　みちを　きいて\n"
	.string "いったよ。　かわった　ひとたちじゃ。$"
